1
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:09,720
=The Forgotten Concubine's Revenge=

2
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:12,760
=Episode 7=

3
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:15,720
(Fu Rong's Fatal Weakness)

4
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:18,400
I'll serve you as a humble maid.

5
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:19,640
I'll do as you command,

6
00:00:20,080 --> 00:00:20,880
and serve you

7
00:00:22,040 --> 00:00:23,080
with all my heart.

8
00:00:35,040 --> 00:00:37,160
(Zhongning Palace)

9
00:00:51,080 --> 00:00:52,960
(The Eldest Prince,
son of the late Empress)

10
00:01:04,520 --> 00:01:05,320
Consort Qi.

11
00:01:05,960 --> 00:01:08,480
You've devoted yourself all these years

12
00:01:08,520 --> 00:01:10,400
to raising the eldest prince

13
00:01:10,600 --> 00:01:11,520
for the late Empress.

14
00:01:11,720 --> 00:01:12,440
Your Majesty.

15
00:01:12,720 --> 00:01:14,440
Though I was once

16
00:01:14,440 --> 00:01:16,080
the late Empress's maid,

17
00:01:16,080 --> 00:01:18,160
she treated me like a sister.

18
00:01:18,360 --> 00:01:19,920
Sadly, she passed away from illness.

19
00:01:20,560 --> 00:01:23,320
All I can do is care
for the eldest prince

20
00:01:23,400 --> 00:01:25,480
to comfort her spirit in heaven.

21
00:01:25,840 --> 00:01:26,480
Father.

22
00:01:26,760 --> 00:01:27,840
When Mother passed,

23
00:01:27,840 --> 00:01:28,920
I was still young.

24
00:01:29,160 --> 00:01:30,080
But I know

25
00:01:30,120 --> 00:01:32,800
I must repay both the debt
of birth and upbringing.

26
00:01:32,960 --> 00:01:34,880
Our dynasty values
loyalty and filial piety.

27
00:01:34,960 --> 00:01:36,960
I'll follow your example, Father.

28
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:38,280
I'll study hard

29
00:01:38,360 --> 00:01:40,000
to share your burdens one day.

30
00:01:41,080 --> 00:01:41,880
Look at you.

31
00:01:42,200 --> 00:01:43,240
You've grown up.

32
00:01:44,680 --> 00:01:46,280
Your Majesty, Your Highness.

33
00:01:46,480 --> 00:01:48,320
Physician Li is here to
check Your Highness's pulse.

34
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:50,560
You're unwell, Consort Qi?

35
00:01:50,880 --> 00:01:52,120
Why didn't you tell me?

36
00:01:52,440 --> 00:01:53,960
It's an old ailment,

37
00:01:54,080 --> 00:01:55,080
nothing serious.

38
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:56,760
Your health comes first.

39
00:01:56,880 --> 00:01:58,520
Have the physician
examine you carefully.

40
00:01:58,920 --> 00:01:59,560
Go on.

41
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:02,520
I'll admire the chrysanthemums here.

42
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:04,920
Then I'll dine here tonight.

43
00:02:05,800 --> 00:02:06,800
As you wish, Your Majesty.

44
00:02:07,760 --> 00:02:08,560
Your Majesty.

45
00:02:08,880 --> 00:02:12,240
The eldest prince's poems and paintings
are displayed there.

46
00:02:12,360 --> 00:02:14,200
He hopes for your guidance.

47
00:02:14,440 --> 00:02:15,440
If it pleases Your Majesty,

48
00:02:15,600 --> 00:02:16,840
perhaps you could take a look.

49
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:17,400
Good.

50
00:02:17,800 --> 00:02:18,400
Go ahead.

51
00:02:18,760 --> 00:02:19,880
I'll take my leave.

52
00:02:56,560 --> 00:02:58,200
Your Majesty.

53
00:02:58,560 --> 00:02:59,520
Why are you here?

54
00:03:00,240 --> 00:03:00,840
Fu Rong,

55
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:02,080
all of these...

56
00:03:02,680 --> 00:03:03,760
Did you paint them?

57
00:03:04,240 --> 00:03:05,000
Yes.

58
00:03:07,800 --> 00:03:10,200
You've captured
the late Empress so well.

59
00:03:10,840 --> 00:03:11,760
Your skill

60
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:14,680
rivals that of the palace painters.

61
00:03:15,280 --> 00:03:15,880
Take a look.

62
00:03:16,160 --> 00:03:18,240
There are so few portraits
of your mother.

63
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:19,080
This one

64
00:03:19,480 --> 00:03:21,160
looks just like her when she was young.

65
00:03:21,680 --> 00:03:24,200
She was radiant back then.

66
00:03:25,440 --> 00:03:26,200
Your Majesty.

67
00:03:26,400 --> 00:03:29,320
I heard Consort Qi
missed the late Empress,

68
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:30,760
so I dared to offer my work.

69
00:03:31,040 --> 00:03:32,080
Your Majesty,

70
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:33,560
please don't blame me

71
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:35,120
for someone of low status

72
00:03:35,520 --> 00:03:36,480
presuming to portray her.

73
00:03:36,880 --> 00:03:37,680
Your Majesty.

74
00:03:39,880 --> 00:03:40,680
Your Majesty.

75
00:03:41,160 --> 00:03:43,320
I brought Fu Rong here.

76
00:03:43,440 --> 00:03:44,640
If you're displeased,

77
00:03:44,880 --> 00:03:46,960
I'll send her back to the cold palace.

78
00:03:47,200 --> 00:03:48,160
Forgive me, Your Majesty.

79
00:03:48,320 --> 00:03:49,520
Forgive me, Your Highness.

80
00:03:49,920 --> 00:03:51,920
I know I've committed grave sins.

81
00:03:52,040 --> 00:03:53,960
I often repented in the cold palace.

82
00:03:54,400 --> 00:03:55,440
I was wrong.

83
00:03:55,840 --> 00:03:58,120
I shouldn't have disturbed you both.

84
00:03:58,600 --> 00:03:59,920
I'll return to the cold palace now.

85
00:04:03,920 --> 00:04:04,720
By my decree.

86
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:05,640
Effective immediately,

87
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:07,400
restore Cairen Rong's rank.

88
00:04:08,480 --> 00:04:10,920
She'll stay in
Zhongning Palace's side hall.

89
00:04:11,760 --> 00:04:12,800
As you command, Your Majesty.

90
00:04:16,880 --> 00:04:18,120
Thank you, Your Majesty.

91
00:04:21,720 --> 00:04:23,640
(I mustn't get dragged in again.)

92
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:26,280
(She's drawn me into
the harem's factions.)

93
00:04:26,760 --> 00:04:27,800
(One misstep,)

94
00:04:28,200 --> 00:04:30,240
(and my entire family could be doomed.)

95
00:04:32,200 --> 00:04:34,840
(Lijing Pavilion)

96
00:04:43,080 --> 00:04:43,720
Your Highness,

97
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:46,520
thank you for saving me.

98
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:49,200
Cairen Rong, please rise.

99
00:04:51,720 --> 00:04:54,440
You suffered the loss of your daughter,

100
00:04:54,520 --> 00:04:56,440
and in your grief,
you were sent to the cold palace.

101
00:04:56,680 --> 00:04:58,280
I really felt for you.

102
00:04:59,040 --> 00:05:01,040
Now that His Majesty
has favored you again,

103
00:05:01,080 --> 00:05:02,120
it's your good fortune.

104
00:05:02,400 --> 00:05:04,560
I just went along with it.

105
00:05:05,040 --> 00:05:06,760
Your Highness is so benevolent,

106
00:05:06,840 --> 00:05:07,800
and so virtuous.

107
00:05:08,080 --> 00:05:09,320
You're a model for the harem.

108
00:05:10,560 --> 00:05:11,680
But now,

109
00:05:12,200 --> 00:05:13,880
Noble Consort Hui rules the harem.

110
00:05:14,400 --> 00:05:15,520
Your virtue

111
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:17,800
cannot benefit the other consorts.

112
00:05:17,960 --> 00:05:18,920
What a shame.

113
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:21,360
Noble Consort Hui is
the Empress Dowager's niece.

114
00:05:21,600 --> 00:05:23,000
Her status is incomparably noble.

115
00:05:23,120 --> 00:05:25,720
How could I ever rival her?

116
00:05:26,920 --> 00:05:28,440
Your Highness has been so kind to me.

117
00:05:28,840 --> 00:05:31,000
I'm willing to serve you

118
00:05:31,160 --> 00:05:33,600
and help you gain power over the harem,

119
00:05:33,760 --> 00:05:36,640
so all the consorts
may share in your grace.

120
00:05:40,240 --> 00:05:41,160
Come in.

121
00:05:47,720 --> 00:05:50,560
I've chosen two capable maids
to serve you.

122
00:05:50,760 --> 00:05:52,320
If you need anything else,

123
00:05:52,360 --> 00:05:53,920
just let me know.

124
00:05:54,920 --> 00:05:56,360
Thank you, Consort Qi.

125
00:05:57,000 --> 00:05:58,840
Greetings, Cairen Rong.

126
00:05:59,320 --> 00:06:00,200
Rise.

127
00:06:00,240 --> 00:06:01,320
(Chunli, Personal Maid)
Thank you, Your Highness.

128
00:06:03,960 --> 00:06:04,720
Your Highness.

129
00:06:04,720 --> 00:06:06,800
(Lyu'e, Personal Maid)
I've always served you.

130
00:06:06,960 --> 00:06:08,680
When you served me,

131
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:10,040
you were always diligent,

132
00:06:10,040 --> 00:06:11,000
and never faulted.

133
00:06:11,280 --> 00:06:14,600
That's why I chose you
to serve Cairen Rong.

134
00:06:14,720 --> 00:06:17,080
Serve her well from now on.

135
00:06:17,360 --> 00:06:18,200
Understood?

136
00:06:19,120 --> 00:06:19,920
Yes.

137
00:06:21,120 --> 00:06:22,360
It's getting late.

138
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:23,800
Rest early tonight.

139
00:06:23,920 --> 00:06:25,520
I'll be going now.

140
00:06:26,600 --> 00:06:27,720
Take care.

141
00:06:33,160 --> 00:06:34,400
You may leave as well.

142
00:06:34,520 --> 00:06:35,440
Rest early tonight.

143
00:06:35,680 --> 00:06:36,480
Yes.

144
00:06:36,800 --> 00:06:37,600
Yes.

145
00:06:51,480 --> 00:06:52,400
(Noble Consort Hui.)

146
00:06:53,520 --> 00:06:55,520
(Everyone fears your high status,)

147
00:06:56,000 --> 00:06:57,840
(because the Empress Dowager backs you.)

148
00:06:59,200 --> 00:07:00,720
(Then I'll find a way)

149
00:07:01,120 --> 00:07:03,200
(to strip you of your rank and support,)

150
00:07:03,920 --> 00:07:07,560
(then torture you to death, bit by bit.)

151
00:07:08,080 --> 00:07:09,480
(Only then)

152
00:07:09,640 --> 00:07:11,880
(will my hatred be satisfied.)

153
00:07:16,320 --> 00:07:17,640
She's regained His Majesty's favor?

154
00:07:17,920 --> 00:07:19,400
That wretch!

155
00:07:19,400 --> 00:07:20,520
So full of tricks.

156
00:07:20,920 --> 00:07:23,320
She's using Consort Qi to come after me!

157
00:07:23,720 --> 00:07:24,840
All of you, leave.

158
00:07:25,280 --> 00:07:26,160
Thanks, Your Highness.

159
00:07:32,200 --> 00:07:32,680
Your Highness,

160
00:07:33,040 --> 00:07:35,080
Fu Rong alone is easy to handle.

161
00:07:35,520 --> 00:07:36,520
But Consort Qi...

162
00:07:36,640 --> 00:07:38,560
With the late Empress
and the prince behind her,

163
00:07:38,800 --> 00:07:40,240
she has His Majesty's favor.

164
00:07:40,400 --> 00:07:41,920
Now they've joined hands,

165
00:07:42,280 --> 00:07:43,440
it'll be much harder

166
00:07:43,600 --> 00:07:44,800
for you to deal with her.

167
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:47,280
I'm the Empress Dowager's own niece!

168
00:07:47,600 --> 00:07:50,000
Why would I fear two lowborn women?

169
00:07:51,440 --> 00:07:53,080
Fu Rong knows the cold palace's secrets.

170
00:07:53,800 --> 00:07:55,840
And now she's allied with Consort Qi.

171
00:07:57,400 --> 00:07:58,200
No.

172
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:00,320
I can't let them

173
00:08:00,320 --> 00:08:01,680
join forces against me.

174
00:08:27,200 --> 00:08:29,680
We were sent to serve in this side hall.

175
00:08:29,840 --> 00:08:31,280
Yet you grovel at her feet.

176
00:08:31,520 --> 00:08:32,680
What a shameless wretch.

177
00:08:32,680 --> 00:08:33,360
Sister Lyu'e.

178
00:08:33,360 --> 00:08:34,560
Please, that's enough.

179
00:08:34,800 --> 00:08:36,600
Cairen Rong is our master, after all.

180
00:08:36,680 --> 00:08:37,680
We should know our place.

181
00:08:37,680 --> 00:08:38,360
Cairen?

182
00:08:38,800 --> 00:08:41,160
I used to serve Consort Qi herself.

183
00:08:41,400 --> 00:08:43,800
She's merely a low-ranking concubine
out of the cold palace.

184
00:08:43,840 --> 00:08:44,720
She's of low birth,

185
00:08:44,720 --> 00:08:45,760
and her family is beneath mine.

186
00:08:46,400 --> 00:08:48,400
Sister, please stop.

187
00:08:49,360 --> 00:08:51,880
Chunli, stay sharp.

188
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:54,560
Don't let her drag you down with her.

189
00:09:14,360 --> 00:09:15,720
This late at night,

190
00:09:15,760 --> 00:09:17,360
what's she sneaking around for?

191
00:09:40,560 --> 00:09:41,440
Joss paper?

192
00:09:41,840 --> 00:09:43,240
Everyone in the palace knows

193
00:09:43,440 --> 00:09:46,160
Duanjing, sent to marry for an alliance,
died of illness in a foreign land.

194
00:09:46,520 --> 00:09:48,080
The Empress Dowager fainted from grief.

195
00:09:48,200 --> 00:09:50,680
She then forbade the burning of
joss paper in the palace.

196
00:09:51,960 --> 00:09:52,920
Anyone who breaks the rule

197
00:09:52,920 --> 00:09:53,800
shall be beaten to death.

198
00:09:54,160 --> 00:09:54,880
This...

199
00:09:55,240 --> 00:09:57,200
Cairen Rong is so outrageous.

200
00:09:57,600 --> 00:09:58,920
If she's caught,

201
00:09:59,040 --> 00:10:00,640
I'll be dragged down with her.

202
00:10:00,840 --> 00:10:01,720
Sister Lyu'e.

203
00:10:02,640 --> 00:10:03,680
It's so late.

204
00:10:03,720 --> 00:10:05,160
What are you muttering about here?

205
00:10:05,640 --> 00:10:06,480
Nothing.

206
00:10:06,560 --> 00:10:07,680
Come with me.

207
00:10:07,800 --> 00:10:09,080
Noble Consort Hui summons you.

208
00:10:09,280 --> 00:10:10,120
Noble Consort Hui?

209
00:10:18,880 --> 00:10:20,440
Your Highness.

210
00:10:21,080 --> 00:10:21,880
Rise.

211
00:10:22,160 --> 00:10:23,080
Thank you, Your Highness.

212
00:10:24,720 --> 00:10:27,600
I recall you served in Zhongning Palace,

213
00:10:27,880 --> 00:10:29,440
attending Consort Qi.

214
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:31,960
Now you've been sent to
serve Cairen Rong.

215
00:10:31,960 --> 00:10:33,280
That must be hard on you.

216
00:10:34,320 --> 00:10:35,960
I just want to ask you.

217
00:10:36,120 --> 00:10:37,720
Does Cairen Rong

218
00:10:37,720 --> 00:10:39,440
ever behave in an improper manner?

219
00:10:39,600 --> 00:10:41,480
Tell me everything you know.

220
00:10:42,800 --> 00:10:44,160
Thank you for your concern,
Your Highness.

221
00:10:44,520 --> 00:10:46,120
Cairen Rong...

222
00:10:46,480 --> 00:10:47,360
She's low in rank

223
00:10:47,360 --> 00:10:48,480
but terribly haughty.

224
00:10:48,640 --> 00:10:49,560
She looks down

225
00:10:49,560 --> 00:10:50,920
on us servants.

226
00:10:51,080 --> 00:10:52,080
And I also saw...

227
00:10:53,960 --> 00:10:54,680
You saw what?

228
00:10:55,280 --> 00:10:56,520
Just now, I saw her

229
00:10:56,840 --> 00:10:59,040
sneaking back with a basket.

230
00:10:59,160 --> 00:11:00,440
Inside the basket...

231
00:11:00,680 --> 00:11:02,680
Were candles and joss paper.

232
00:11:02,960 --> 00:11:03,760
What?

233
00:11:04,200 --> 00:11:05,600
I saw it clearly.

234
00:11:05,920 --> 00:11:06,960
I was thinking...

235
00:11:07,080 --> 00:11:08,360
Could Cairen Rong be planning

236
00:11:08,920 --> 00:11:10,880
to burn joss paper in secret?

237
00:11:12,120 --> 00:11:12,720
Your Highness.

238
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:14,240
Folk say,

239
00:11:14,240 --> 00:11:16,920
if a child who dies unjustly
isn't prayed for and given proper rites,

240
00:11:17,040 --> 00:11:18,560
the child becomes a wandering ghost

241
00:11:18,560 --> 00:11:20,000
and is barred from rebirth.

242
00:11:20,240 --> 00:11:22,560
She must be offering prayers
for Princess Lingxi.

243
00:11:23,520 --> 00:11:24,560
That wretch.

244
00:11:25,200 --> 00:11:26,760
So treasonous.

245
00:11:27,120 --> 00:11:29,120
She dares ignore palace rules.

246
00:11:29,720 --> 00:11:31,080
The Empress Dowager's Princess Duanjing

247
00:11:31,080 --> 00:11:32,560
died at this very time last year.

248
00:11:33,080 --> 00:11:35,480
She still weeps
whenever she recalls the princess.

249
00:11:36,280 --> 00:11:38,800
And she dares defy
the Empress Dowager's decree.

250
00:11:48,920 --> 00:11:49,840
Thank you, Your Highness.

251
00:11:56,440 --> 00:11:57,240
Take this back.

252
00:11:57,680 --> 00:11:59,480
Put it in the basket
with her joss paper.

253
00:11:59,800 --> 00:12:01,240
Your Highness, this...

254
00:12:01,440 --> 00:12:02,640
Do as you're told,

255
00:12:03,240 --> 00:12:05,360
and I'll bring you to Chengxi Palace.

256
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:06,800
How's that?

257
00:12:10,320 --> 00:12:11,160
Rest assured, Your Highness.

258
00:12:11,400 --> 00:12:12,760
I'll see it done.

259
00:12:13,440 --> 00:12:14,240
You may leave.

260
00:12:14,520 --> 00:12:15,320
Yes.

261
00:12:20,720 --> 00:12:21,680
How wise, Your Highness.

262
00:12:22,160 --> 00:12:23,840
She's offended the Empress Dowager.

263
00:12:24,040 --> 00:12:25,200
She's as good as dead.

264
00:12:25,560 --> 00:12:28,040
This time, I'll use the Empress Dowager

265
00:12:28,600 --> 00:12:29,880
to end her for good.

266
00:12:31,880 --> 00:12:33,440
I have a task for you.

267
00:12:43,440 --> 00:12:44,320
Yes, Your Highness.

268
00:12:48,160 --> 00:12:48,920
Your Highness.

269
00:12:50,360 --> 00:12:51,120
Your Highness.

270
00:13:12,480 --> 00:13:13,240
(Cairen Rong.)

271
00:13:13,440 --> 00:13:14,960
(You dared defy
the Empress Dowager's decree)

272
00:13:15,080 --> 00:13:16,320
(and burn joss paper in secret.)

273
00:13:16,560 --> 00:13:17,800
(You brought this upon yourself.)

274
00:13:17,800 --> 00:13:18,960
(Don't blame me.)

275
00:13:25,440 --> 00:13:27,400
Lyu'e, what are you doing here?

276
00:13:27,880 --> 00:13:30,200
Cairen Rong asked you to
deliver some embroidery.

277
00:13:30,200 --> 00:13:31,000
Hurry along.

278
00:13:31,920 --> 00:13:32,520
Sure.

279
00:13:32,600 --> 00:13:33,600
I'm coming.

280
00:13:43,600 --> 00:13:44,880
(Poor Lingxi met such a cruel end.)

281
00:13:45,280 --> 00:13:46,440
(If I don't burn joss paper for her,)

282
00:13:46,920 --> 00:13:48,640
(will she become a lost ghost?)

283
00:13:52,960 --> 00:13:54,760
A little walk after a meal is lovely.

284
00:13:57,160 --> 00:13:59,080
Walking is good for you too.

285
00:13:59,680 --> 00:14:01,160
How thoughtful, Noble Consort Hui.

286
00:14:04,640 --> 00:14:05,400
What is that?

287
00:14:06,160 --> 00:14:07,960
Get it away from me!

288
00:14:08,040 --> 00:14:08,840
Careful, Your Highness!

289
00:14:10,880 --> 00:14:11,880
Away, away!

290
00:14:12,080 --> 00:14:12,880
Guards.

291
00:14:12,920 --> 00:14:14,320
Drive those bats away now!

292
00:14:18,480 --> 00:14:19,280
They're gone.

293
00:14:19,440 --> 00:14:20,160
Let's get back.

294
00:14:23,840 --> 00:14:25,160
I shouldn't have come out.

295
00:14:25,160 --> 00:14:26,480
Look, Your Highness.

296
00:14:33,360 --> 00:14:33,960
Your Highness!

297
00:14:34,480 --> 00:14:35,160
Your Highness!

298
00:14:35,160 --> 00:14:36,000
Your Highness...

299
00:14:36,280 --> 00:14:37,240
Get the physician. Now!

300
00:14:37,400 --> 00:14:38,200
Yes.

301
00:14:38,520 --> 00:14:39,320
Your Highness!

302
00:14:39,520 --> 00:14:40,080
Your Highness!

303
00:14:40,080 --> 00:14:41,320
Are you alright?

304
00:14:53,880 --> 00:14:54,680
Your Majesty.

305
00:14:55,160 --> 00:14:56,200
How is the Empress Dowager?

306
00:14:56,200 --> 00:14:56,840
Your Majesty.

307
00:14:57,040 --> 00:14:58,120
The fright has disturbed

308
00:14:58,120 --> 00:14:59,000
her qi and blood.

309
00:14:59,000 --> 00:15:00,200
Her inner fire flares.

310
00:15:00,280 --> 00:15:02,160
I'll prepare several calming remedies.

311
00:15:02,360 --> 00:15:03,920
With a few days' rest, she'll recover.

312
00:15:04,880 --> 00:15:07,040
See that the Empress Dowager rests well.

313
00:15:07,360 --> 00:15:08,160
Yes.

314
00:15:08,480 --> 00:15:11,240
Your Majesty, first bats
without warning,

315
00:15:11,280 --> 00:15:13,120
then bloody handprints on the walls.

316
00:15:13,560 --> 00:15:15,640
These strange omens have
disturbed the Empress Dowager.

317
00:15:15,760 --> 00:15:17,120
I'm deeply worried.

318
00:15:17,200 --> 00:15:18,960
I fear they foretell ill fortune.

319
00:15:19,880 --> 00:15:21,880
Summon Lord Sun of
the Imperial Observatory.

320
00:15:21,960 --> 00:15:22,760
Yes.

321
00:15:36,480 --> 00:15:37,440
Your Majesty.

322
00:15:37,760 --> 00:15:38,720
I've observed the heavens.

323
00:15:39,000 --> 00:15:40,720
Turbid qi has appeared
in the Taiwei Enclosure,

324
00:15:40,800 --> 00:15:41,840
and points toward the harem.

325
00:15:42,040 --> 00:15:43,000
The stars indicate

326
00:15:43,160 --> 00:15:45,320
the Kun position in the southwest.

327
00:15:48,040 --> 00:15:49,840
The southwest corner of the harem...

328
00:15:50,440 --> 00:15:51,280
The southwest?

329
00:15:51,920 --> 00:15:53,400
Isn't that Zhongning Palace?

330
00:15:57,360 --> 00:15:58,360
Your Majesty, please see the truth.

331
00:15:58,880 --> 00:16:00,840
Zhongning Palace
has always been peaceful.

332
00:16:01,080 --> 00:16:02,960
No evil has ever arisen here.

333
00:16:03,240 --> 00:16:04,040
Consort Qi.

334
00:16:04,640 --> 00:16:06,680
This concerns
the Empress Dowager's health.

335
00:16:06,960 --> 00:16:09,160
Have a Daoist priest
perform a rite tomorrow

336
00:16:09,280 --> 00:16:10,600
to ward off evil and purify the palace.

337
00:16:12,160 --> 00:16:13,440
For the Empress Dowager's well-being,

338
00:16:13,920 --> 00:16:15,360
I will comply.

339
00:16:15,800 --> 00:16:16,600
Mm.

340
00:16:18,640 --> 00:16:20,600
(I've arranged everything.)

341
00:16:21,360 --> 00:16:24,360
(I'll make sure you both
suffer a fate worse than death.)

342
00:16:30,080 --> 00:16:34,560
♪I've wandered through this world
all my life♪

343
00:16:35,000 --> 00:16:39,600
♪As the years go by,
we learn to be alone♪

344
00:16:39,800 --> 00:16:44,400
♪I see leaves fall from the old tree
by my window♪

345
00:16:44,640 --> 00:16:49,240
♪When flowers bloom and swallows return,
I hope you are still here♪

346
00:16:49,520 --> 00:16:54,000
♪I hear rain whisper in my ear♪

347
00:16:54,440 --> 00:16:59,040
♪I send my longing to you far away♪

348
00:16:59,240 --> 00:17:03,840
♪I wait for dawn to break the mist
and you to find your way home♪

349
00:17:04,200 --> 00:17:08,800
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

350
00:17:08,960 --> 00:17:13,560
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

351
00:17:13,840 --> 00:17:17,000
♪Let the stars and sea♪

352
00:17:17,000 --> 00:17:18,500
(Changsheng Gate)

353
00:17:18,500 --> 00:17:22,320
♪Wait for your return♪
